// in this binary was proven against the real thing it fronts -- hook and
// mcp against a real claude session, extauthz against a real Envoy
// (deploy/docker/envoy.yaml, echo-upstream) -- and proxy's own real thing is
// an ordinary gRPC service with its own compiled request/response types, not
// the hand-rolled raw-byte proxyFrame cmd/stratium-pep/proxy_test.go's own
// unit tests construct directly. Deployed as deploy/docker/grpc-target
// (own Dockerfile, own docker-compose.yml service), analogous to
// echo-upstream's role for Phase 10's real Envoy proof.
//
